    "<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下四題涵蓋計算、概念整合與環境證據判讀。題目難度高於前面的理解檢查，但不需要進階大學化學知識。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">建議先自行作答，不提供預設解答。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><button class=\"Box-JYjgF4 Pressable-QEXFz7\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"pressable\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\" type=\"button\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 1 題｜原子經濟性與產率</p><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></button>石灰石分解反應為 CaCO₃ → CaO + CO₂。已知 Ca=40、C=12、O=16。投入 200 g 純 CaCO₃，實際取得 CaO 100.8 g。<ol class=\"List-bYalj1\" data-d-component=\"list\" data-d-marker=\"number\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\" style=\"--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\">計算本反應以 CaO 為目標產物的原子經濟性。</div></div></li><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\">計算 CaO 的實際產率。</div></div></li><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\">若要評估此製程是否符合綠色化學，除了上述兩個數值，還應考慮哪些因素？</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\">",
