\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><button class=\"Box-JYjgF4 Pressable-QEXFz7\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"pressable\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\" type=\"button\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 3 題｜氮循環與氧化還原</p><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 16px;\">",
